# Local QA tooling — deliberately NOT committed (2026-07-31).
# `npm i -D playwright` for the Forge QA harness leaves a package.json behind. This is a
# static site with no build step (see vercel.json — headers/rewrites/redirects only), and a
# committed package.json is exactly the signal that makes Vercel start running an install on
# every deploy: 19MB of node_modules pulled to serve HTML that never needed it.
# Install playwright locally when the harness is needed; keep it out of the repo.
package.json
package-lock.json
forge-qa-output/

# QA tooling artifacts, not part of the site (added 2026-07-31).
# package.json here is only playwright for forge-qa.mjs — do NOT commit it:
# this is a static site with no build step, and a package.json is exactly the
# signal that makes Vercel start looking for one.
package.json
package-lock.json
forge-qa-output/
